Sends updates to a Discord bot.

Usage:
>>> from tqdm.contrib.discord import tqdm, trange
>>> for i in trange(10, token='{token}', channel_id='{channel_id}'):
...     ...

![screenshot](https://tqdm.github.io/img/screenshot-discord.png)
